  <h1>Reading</h1>

  <h2>Why I Love It</h2>
  <p>
    I enjoy reading because it opens up entire worlds of imagination and knowledge. The most <strong>important</strong> part is how it allows me to connect with ideas across cultures and times, making me feel both inspired and grounded.
  </p>

  <h2>How to Start</h2>
  <p>
    Begin by choosing a book that truly interests you, whether it’s fiction, history, or science. Don’t worry if you encounter a technical term like <em>bildungsroman</em>; exploring such words is part of the fun and deepens your understanding.
  </p>
